OL,3,ABritish soldier who died in Ukraine
OL,4,Aroad accident named by MoD
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe member of the UK armed forces who
OL,7,Fdied in a road traffic accident in
OL,8,FUkraine last week has been named as
OL,9,FMajor Paul Wilks.
OL,11,FThe Ministry of Defence (MoD) described
OL,12,Fthe 40-year-old as a "gifted leader who
OL,13,Fearned the admiration and respect of
OL,14,Fall those fortunate enough to have
OL,15,Fserved alongside him".
OL,17,FThe incident on Saturday was not the
OL,18,Fresult of hostile action, the BBC
OL,19,Funderstands, with the MoD stating that
OL,20,Fthe accident happened "away from the
OL,21,Ffront lines".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
